{"4319350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Within of Static - Northgate Mall", "steam_appid": 4319350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Within of Static</strong> is an episodic, first-person psychological horror anthology inspired by grounded, human fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode tells a self-contained story based on those who claim to have lived through it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode Two: Northgate Mall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the role of <strong>Dylan Miller</strong>, a night security guard working a late shift at a partially closed shopping mall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is routine: monitor security cameras, stay in contact with the central office, and keep the place quiet until morning. But as the night progresses, small irregularities begin to surface — strange noises, missing signals, and figures that don’t belong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As tension builds, Dylan is forced to question what’s really happening inside Northgate Mall… and whether he was ever meant to witness it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319350/extras/80b259c91f9281dbf3c07b3218e43461.poster.avif?t=1772047421\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319350/extras/80b259c91f9281dbf3c07b3218e43461.webm?t=1772047421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319350/extras/80b259c91f9281dbf3c07b3218e43461.mp4?t=1772047421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player, narrative-driven walking simulator focused on tension, environmental storytelling, and realistic human horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments, interact with objects, communicate through your devices, and experience a story that unfolds in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric, grounded horror.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS-inspired visual style.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Microphone Interaction</strong> — your voice may matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Text-based NPC interactions</strong> through your in-game phone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic environments</strong> built for slow-burn tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, focused experience</strong> designed to be played in one sitting.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Within of Static</strong> is an episodic, first-person psychological horror anthology inspired by grounded, human fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode tells a self-contained story based on those who claim to have lived through it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode Two: Northgate Mall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the role of <strong>Dylan Miller</strong>, a night security guard working a late shift at a partially closed shopping mall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is routine: monitor security cameras, stay in contact with the central office, and keep the place quiet until morning. But as the night progresses, small irregularities begin to surface — strange noises, missing signals, and figures that don’t belong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As tension builds, Dylan is forced to question what’s really happening inside Northgate Mall… and whether he was ever meant to witness it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319350/extras/80b259c91f9281dbf3c07b3218e43461.poster.avif?t=1772047421\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319350/extras/80b259c91f9281dbf3c07b3218e43461.webm?t=1772047421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319350/extras/80b259c91f9281dbf3c07b3218e43461.mp4?t=1772047421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player, narrative-driven walking simulator focused on tension, environmental storytelling, and realistic human horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments, interact with objects, communicate through your devices, and experience a story that unfolds in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric, grounded horror.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS-inspired visual style.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Microphone Interaction</strong> — your voice may matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Text-based NPC interactions</strong> through your in-game phone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic environments</strong> built for slow-burn tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, focused experience</strong> designed to be played in one sitting.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You play as Dylan Miller, a night security guard assigned to watch over the nearly abandoned Northgate Mall. What starts as a